-cse-final-year-projects\/#faq-question-1786013664892","position":7,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/computer-science-cse-final-year-projects\/#faq-question-1786013664892","name":"7. What are some popular programming languages for computer science final year projects?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Python dominates AI and data projects, Java and PHP suit management systems, and JavaScript powers web-based builds. Pick the language based on the project requirement, not familiarity alone.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/computer-science-cse-final-year-projects\/#faq-question-1786013680230","position":8,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/computer-science-cse-final-year-projects\/#faq-question-1786013680230","name":"8. Should I choose a machine learning project or a web development project?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Choose machine learning if you are targeting data or AI roles, and web development if you want full-stack or SDE roles. Both are equally\u00a0valid\u00a0final year project ideas for computer science students.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/computer-science-cse-final-year-projects\/#faq-question-1786013769216","position":9,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/computer-science-cse-final-year-projects\/#faq-question-1786013769216","name":"9. Can I work on a computer science project individually or with a team?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Both are acceptable. Solo projects show depth and ownership, while team projects\u00a0demonstrate\u00a0collaboration, version control, and task management skills that recruiters actively look for.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/computer-science-cse-final-year-projects\/#faq-question-1786013791050","position":10,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/computer-science-cse-final-year-projects\/#faq-question-1786013791050","name":"10. How do I prepare for my project viva and presentation?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Know every line of your code and be ready to justify your tech stack choices. Examiners usually ask why you selected a particular algorithm, database, or framework over the alternatives.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"}]}},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4768","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/8"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4768"}],"version-history":[{"count":58,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4768\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":22829,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4768\/revisions\/22829"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/22827"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4768"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=4768"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=4768"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}